TI  - Efficacy and safety of efinopegdutide in adults with metabolic dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis and stage 2-3 fibrosis: a phase 2b, randomised, placebo-controlled study.
AU  - Lawitz Eric
AU  - Wong Vincent Wai-Sun
AU  - Shankar R Ravi
AU  - Francque Sven
AU  - Patel Keyur
AU  - Miele Luca
AU  - Abdelmalek Manal F
