TI  - Case Report: GADA-positive type 1 diabetes with diabetic ketoacidosis in a young adult with obesity temporally associated with unsupervised tirzepatide use for weight reduction.
AU  - Lei Mengyun
AU  - Liu Fang
AU  - Sun Li
AU  - Li Shuting
