TI  - GLP-1 Receptor Agonist-Based Prandial Insulin De-Intensification in Outpatients With Type 2 Diabetes Receiving Basal-Bolus Insulin Therapy or Multiple Daily Injections: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Randomised Controlled Trials.
